    [5241]={name="Dwarven Flamestick",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Gathering Idols” — pick it over the other choices. In Loch Modan.",zone="Loch Modan",questName="Gathering Idols",lore="Recently, just before the Troggs surfaced within the site, we had uncovered a large number of strange, carved idols. But we didn't have the chance to study them, for soon after their discovery the Troggs chased us away from the ruins!"},
    [5242]={name="Cinder Wand",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Arugal's Folly” — pick it over the other choices. In Silverpine Forest.",zone="Silverpine Forest",questName="Arugal's Folly",lore="As my understanding of Arugal's magic grows so does my disdain for the hapless fool. I am close to completing my research on his so called remedy."},
    [5243]={name="Firebelcher",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Deviate Faerie Dragon in Wailing Caverns.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Deviate Faerie Dragon"},
    [5245]={name="Summoner's Wand",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Dalaran Summoner in Dalaran.",zone="Dalaran",npc="Dalaran Summoner"},
    [5246]={name="Excavation Rod",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Ormer's Revenge” — pick it over the other choices. In Wetlands.",zone="Wetlands",questName="Ormer's Revenge",lore="While you were down there I happened to notice that one of those beasts stood out from the rest. He was bigger and more menacing. I bet he's the one who led the others here to cause the disruption to the dig site."},
    [5248]={name="Flash Wand",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Pearl Diving” — pick it over the other choices. In Badlands.",zone="Badlands",questName="Pearl Diving",lore="To survive, I have to be tricky! I know the recipe for flash bombs."},
    [5250]={name="Charred Wand",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Dangerous!” — pick it over the other choices. In Hillsbrad Foothills.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",questName="Dangerous!",lore="Dangerous! The following humans of Hillsbrad have been deemed dangerous and are marked for bounty by High Executor Darthalia: Clerk Horrace Whitesteed."},
    [5274]={name="Rose Mantle",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Morganth”. In Redridge Mountains.",zone="Redridge Mountains",questName="Morganth",lore="After much observation, I have discovered Morganth's plans. He searches for the Scythe of Elune...and he may have found it! If he has, then the Redridge Mountains, and the kingdom of Stormwind, will soon feel his dark might."},
    [5306]={name="Wind Rider Staff",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Cry of the Thunderhawk” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Cry of the Thunderhawk",lore="The thunderhawk, is a fierce beast. It is time for you to face them. You must find where it roams, and bring me its wings as proof of your successful hunt."},
    [5310]={name="Sea Dog Britches",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Guns of Northwatch” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Guns of Northwatch",lore="Yet another ship from my fleet has been lost to those overzealous humans at Northwatch Hold! Those bastards must be dealt with. Their paranoia has them in a state of frenzy."},
    [5315]={name="Timberland Armguards",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “WANTED: Murkdeep!” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="WANTED: Murkdeep!",lore="Attention! A reward is being offered for the death of the murloc \"Murkdeep\"."},
    [5326]={name="Flaring Baton",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Escape” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="The Escape",lore="I suppose I'll learn as we go... Couldn't be too hard. Just some buttons here, and a lever or two... Well, are you ready to go?"},
    [5337]={name="Wayfaring Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Stolen Booty” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Stolen Booty",lore="While I'd like to recover all my goods, I'm sure that's not possible. Still, there's a few things that I absolutely must have! As you see, my observatory is ready to go, but it needs the smaller of the two lenses."},
    [5340]={name="Cauldron Stirrer",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Apothecary Zamah”. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Apothecary Zamah",lore="I have rendered the spores you gave me into an emulsion. I must now send it to my associate, Apothecary Zamah. If you were to carry this to her, she can offer you something from our stores of alchemical goods."},
    [5356]={name="Branding Rod",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Isha Awak” — pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Isha Awak",lore="The grand Isha Awak is lord of these waters. Great is his strength, and solemn his pride. The humans on the coast fear him, for he has consumed many of their number."},
    [5458]={name="Dirtwood Belt",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Oakenscowl” — pick it over the other choices. In Teldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Oakenscowl",lore="In a cave along the southern bank of the lake, a timberling named Oakenscowl is spreading corruption to all the creatures that make Lake Al'Ameth their home."},
    [5542]={name="Pearl-clasped Cloak",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [5591]={name="Rain-spotted Cape",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Enchanted Glade” — pick it over the other choices. In Teldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Enchanted Glade",lore="I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade."},
    [5604]={name="Elven Wand",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Bashal'Aran” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Bashal'Aran",lore="It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."},
    [5606]={name="Gardening Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Timberling Sprouts” — pick it over the other choices. In Teldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Timberling Sprouts",lore="Small timberlings are sprouting around the waters of Lake Al'Ameth. I'm afraid these sprouts are beyond help -- we should try to clear them from the land before they grow large enough to cause trouble."},
    [5611]={name="Tear of Grief",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “For Love Eternal”. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="For Love Eternal",lore="In the aftermath of the battles at the Well of Eternity, I heard that Ameth'Aran had been destroyed, its people dead, including my love, Anaya."},
    [5766]={name="Lesser Wizard's Robe",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [5767]={name="Violet Robes",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Frostmane Seer in Kharanos.",zone="Kharanos",npc="Frostmane Seer"},
    [5770]={name="Robes of Arcana",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [5967]={name="Girdle of Nobility",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Brainwashed Noble (rare spawn) in The Deadmines.",zone="The Deadmines",npc="Brainwashed Noble"},
    [5970]={name="Serpent Gloves",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lord Serpentis in Wailing Caverns.",zone="Wailing Caverns",npc="Lord Serpentis"},
    [6060]={name="Flax Bracers",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Damned” — pick it over the other choices. In Deathknell.",zone="Deathknell",questName="The Damned",lore="My duties include tending to our wounded warriors, tailoring armor and clothes, and assisting Shadow Priest Sarvis with whatever else he might need."},
    [6148]={name="Web-covered Boots",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Mother Fang (rare spawn) in Northshire Valley.",zone="Northshire Valley",npc="Mother Fang"},
    [6173]={name="Snow Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “A New Threat” — pick it over the other choices. In Coldridge Valley.",zone="Coldridge Valley",questName="A New Threat",lore="I hope you're here to lend us a hand. After the last trogg attack, we could use all the help we can get. I hear the buggers have been popping up all across the lands, and it seems Coldridge Valley is no exception."},
    [6191]={name="Kimbra Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “WANTED: Chok'sul” — pick it over the other choices. In Loch Modan.",zone="Loch Modan",questName="WANTED: Chok'sul",lore="By order of the Magistrate of Thelsamar: Chok'sul, the ogre presumed to be the leader and coordinator of attacks against the town of Thelsamar, Stonewrought Dam, and the excavation site, is wanted dead through any means necessary."},
    [6199]={name="Black Widow Band",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Leech Widow (rare spawn) in Dun Algaz.",zone="Dun Algaz",npc="Leech Widow"},
    [6202]={name="Fingerless Gloves",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Thuros Lightfingers (rare spawn) in Elwynn Forest.",zone="Elwynn Forest",npc="Thuros Lightfingers"},
    [6215]={name="Balanced Fighting Stick",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Wanted:  \"Hogger\"” — pick it over the other choices. In Elwynn Forest.",zone="Elwynn Forest",questName="Wanted:  \"Hogger\"",lore="Wanted: Hogger A huge gnoll, Hogger, is prowling the woods in southwestern Elwynn. He has overpowered all attempts at his capture. The Stormwind Army has placed a generous bounty on the Gnoll."},
