    [6713]={name="Ripped Pants",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Burning Blade Medallion” — pick it over the other choices. In Valley of Trials.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Burning Blade Medallion",lore="Through my divinations, I see that an item of power hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. It is called the Burning Blade Medallion, and your next task is to find it and remove it from the coven."},
    [6744]={name="Gloves of Kapelan",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Alliance Relations” — pick it over the other choices. In Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Alliance Relations",lore="The fight goes well. Perhaps the Warchief will allow us to return to our homes before the seasons change if we continue to make such great strides in our battle against the demons and their underlings."},
    [6780]={name="Lilac Sash",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Centaur Bounty” — pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Centaur Bounty",lore="Now that you scared the centaur clans, it's time to bleed them. When traveling Desolace, hunt centaur. I don't care which clan you hunt. Just gather ears."},
    [6791]={name="Hellion Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Karnitol Shipwreck” — pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="The Karnitol Shipwreck",lore="Take Karnitol's things back to Roetten in Ironforge and he'll pay you for a job well done. Haha, if you're not careful, he's gonna be so pleased with ya that he'll ask you to join us full time."},
    [6797]={name="Eyepoker",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Questioning Reethe” — pick it over the other choices. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Questioning Reethe",lore="It took a long time, but I found Reethe. He hide good for a human. Ogron worried that he might be crazy after so much time in swamp. You come with me for we go get answers from him."},
    [6803]={name="Prophetic Cane",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Into The Scarlet Monastery” — pick it over the other choices. In Scarlet Monastery.",zone="Scarlet Monastery",questName="Into The Scarlet Monastery",lore="Whilst the Dark Lady tends to the pressing issue of the Lich King's advance to the north, I am seeing to it that matters closer to home are being taken care of accordingly."},
    [6806]={name="Dancing Flame",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Final Passage” — pick it over the other choices. In Thousand Needles.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Final Passage",lore="You have done well. You have passed my test, and the tests before mine. Return to Dorn in Thousand Needles."},
    [6901]={name="Glowing Thresher Cape",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Old Serra'kis in Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Old Serra'kis"},
    [6903]={name="Gaze Dreamer Pants",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Twilight Lord Kelris in Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Twilight Lord Kelris"},
    [6908]={name="Ghamoo-ra's Bind",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ghamoo-ra in Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Ghamoo-ra",lore="Ghamoo-ra is the ancient turtle the naga keep in Blackfathom Deeps -- old enough that the Twilight cultists there treat it as part of the temple."},
    [6910]={name="Leech Pants",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Aku'mai in Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",npc="Aku'mai"},
    [6998]={name="Nimbus Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Twilight Falls”. In Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Twilight Falls",lore="Empowered by the ancient rites of the chaotic Old Gods the members of the Twilight's Hammer strive to bring about the return of their dark patrons and spread death and terror across the world."},
    [7001]={name="Gravestone Scepter",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Blackfathom Villainy” — pick it over the other choices. In Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Blackfathom Villainy",lore="Strength has left me. Your help is needed! Long ago this site was a great temple of Elune. But misfortune led to ruin when the corruption of an Old God seeped up from beneath the earth and tainted the sacred Moon Well."},
    [7004]={name="Prelacy Cape",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Researching the Corruption” — pick it over the other choices. In Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Researching the Corruption",lore="Foolish blood elves toil with demonic magic. Have they not witnessed what happened with the naga and with the satyrs of Kalimdor? I fear that the blood elves will meet a similar deformation."},
    [7026]={name="Linen Belt",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
