    [11824]={name="Cyclopean Band",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ok'thor the Breaker.",npc="Ok'thor the Breaker"},
    [11832]={name="Burst of Knowledge",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ambassador Flamelash in Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Ambassador Flamelash",lore="Ragnaros's envoy to the Dark Iron in Blackrock Depths, sent to keep the dwarves loyal to the Firelord.",proc="Use: Reduces mana cost of all spells by 100 for 10 sec. (15 Min Cooldown)"},
    [11841]={name="Senior Designer's Pantaloons",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Fineous Darkvire in Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Fineous Darkvire"},
    [11848]={name="Flax Belt",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Scavenging Deathknell” — pick it over the other choices. In Deathknell.",zone="Deathknell",questName="Scavenging Deathknell",lore="You there! If you're looking for something to make yourself useful, then listen up! We need fresh out-of-the-ground recruits to head into Deathknell and search for any sort of useful equipment."},
    [11859]={name="Jademoon Orb",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “A Grim Discovery” — pick it over the other choices. In Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="A Grim Discovery",lore="What?! Ah, so I did mention a bounty, didn't I? Well, that'll teach me to open my mouth, won't it? You did the work, so I suppose it is only right you reap the greatest reward from it."},
    [11860]={name="Charged Lightning Rod",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Ledger from Tanaris” — pick it over the other choices. In Searing Gorge.",zone="Searing Gorge",questName="Ledger from Tanaris",lore="Oh, you know what? That reminds me. You wanna finish up a little job I took up while I was in Tanaris? It's easy... Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan was lookin' for some stuff found here in Searing Gorge and a few other places."},
    [11865]={name="Rancor Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Ribbly Screwspigot” — pick it over the other choices. In Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",questName="Ribbly Screwspigot",lore="My brother Ribbly has always been a drain to his family, taking our money and wasting it on one scheme after another."},
    [11904]={name="Spirit of Aquementas",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “It's Dangerous to Go Alone” — pick it over the other choices. In Un'Goro Crater.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="It's Dangerous to Go Alone",lore="I finally remember now... I did come here to fight Blazerunner. I was on a journey, and this was to be the last step. But I am no longer the hero..."},
    [11917]={name="Shizzle's Nozzle Wiper",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Shizzle's Flyer” — pick it over the other choices. In Un'Goro Crater.",zone="Un'Goro Crater",questName="Shizzle's Flyer",lore="I'm making a flying machine! I got stranded here, and I'm absolutely horrible at finding my way around. I'd take a gryphon or wind rider back to Gadgetzan, but those beasts just scare me to death."},
    [11923]={name="The Hammer of Grace",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from the Chest of The Seven after defeating the Seven in Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="The Seven"},
    [11924]={name="Robes of the Royal Crown",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Dagran Thaurissan in Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Emperor Dagran Thaurissan",lore="Emperor of the Dark Iron, whose ancestor's summoning of Ragnaros doomed the clan. He took Moira Bronzebeard prisoner and she chose to stay."},
    [11928]={name="Thaurissan's Royal Scepter",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Dagran Thaurissan in Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Emperor Dagran Thaurissan",lore="Emperor of the Dark Iron, whose ancestor's summoning of Ragnaros doomed the clan. He took Moira Bronzebeard prisoner and she chose to stay."},
    [11929]={name="Haunting Specter Leggings",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from the Chest of The Seven after defeating the Seven in Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="The Seven"},
    [11932]={name="Guiding Stave of Wisdom",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Dagran Thaurissan in Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Emperor Dagran Thaurissan",lore="Emperor of the Dark Iron, whose ancestor's summoning of Ragnaros doomed the clan. He took Moira Bronzebeard prisoner and she chose to stay."},
    [11935]={name="Magmus Stone",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Magmus in Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Magmus"},
    [11936]={name="Relic Hunter Belt",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Absent Minded Prospector” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Absent Minded Prospector",lore="So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus? I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."},
    [11962]={name="Manacle Cuffs",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Love Potion” — pick it over the other choices. In Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",questName="The Love Potion",lore="Oh, the pains of love! My dear Private Rocknot is immune to my charms. I am spurned! It's maddening! You must help me! We succubi know much of love, and I can make a potion to beat down the iron walls around Rocknot's heart."},
    [11981]={name="Lead Band",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 380 creature types around level 15-21. Also found on the auction house."},
    [12053]={name="Volcanic Rock Ring",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 371 creature types around level 16-22. Also found on the auction house."},
    [12110]={name="Raincaster Drape",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Rise of the Machines” — pick it over the other choices. In Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",questName="The Rise of the Machines",lore="This can't be Argelmach! Argelmach was killed ten years ago. How can I be sure? I was the one who killed him. He was a despicable dwarf, hell-bent on twisting my life's work to meet his diabolical needs."},
    [12255]={name="Pale Leggings",sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Thralosh in Stonard.",zone="Stonard",npc="Thralosh"},
    [12295]={name="Leggings of the People's Militia",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Red Leather Bandanas” — pick it over the other choices. In Westfall.",zone="Westfall",questName="Red Leather Bandanas",lore="The Defias Front is constantly shifting. I've been following their movements for quite some time now. On a side note, I've ascertained that many members of the gang can be tracked by the Red Leather Bandanas they wear."},
    [12296]={name="Spark of the People's Militia",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The People's Militia” — pick it over the other choices. In Westfall.",zone="Westfall",questName="The People's Militia",lore="We believe they are hiding out in the Dagger Hills, plotting their next move. Slay the wretches in the name of The People's Militia."},
