    [16791]={name="Silkstream Cuffs",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Book of the Ancients” — pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Book of the Ancients",lore="I entrust you with the Gem of the Serpent. Place this gem on the Serpent Statue's hand on Ranazjar Isle, a small island northwest of here. Placing it will summon the one who protects the Book of the Ancients."},
    [16887]={name="Witch's Finger",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Baron Aquanis” — pick it over the other choices. In Ashenvale.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Baron Aquanis",lore="The defeated water elemental has left behind a strange water globe. You surmise that the object somehow fed the beast energy. Inside the globe, a putrid-looking form of water sloshes about."},
    [16919]={name="Boots of Transcendence",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Broodlord Lashlayer in Blackwing Lair.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Broodlord Lashlayer",lore="Nefarian's lieutenant, posted to hold the only way deeper into the lair."},
    [16920]={name="Handguards of Transcendence",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ebonroc in Blackwing Lair.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Ebonroc",lore="One of three drakes guarding Nefarian's inner lair, and the one that heals itself off the wounds it deals."},
    [16921]={name="Halo of Transcendence",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Onyxia in Onyxia's Lair.",zone="Onyxia's Lair",npc="Onyxia",lore="Deathwing's daughter and Nefarian's sister. She spent years in Stormwind as Lady Katrana Prestor, advising the throne she was working to undermine."},
    [16922]={name="Leggings of Transcendence",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ragnaros.",npc="Ragnaros",lore="The Firelord, one of the four Elemental Lords, bound to the Elemental Plane until the Dark Iron dwarves summoned him under Blackrock Mountain. The summoning cracked the mountain open and made the Molten Core."},
    [16923]={name="Robes of Transcendence",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Nefarian.",npc="Nefarian",lore="Deathwing's son, working under Blackrock Mountain to breed the chromatic flight -- dragons carrying the blood of all five. He spent years in Stormwind's court as Lord Victor Nefarius while the work went on."},
    [16924]={name="Pauldrons of Transcendence",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Chromaggus in Blackwing Lair.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Chromaggus",lore="Nefarian's best result: a two-headed chromatic horror carrying the breath of every dragonflight at once."},
    [16925]={name="Belt of Transcendence",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Vaelastrasz the Corrupt in Blackwing Lair.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Vaelastrasz the Corrupt",lore="A red dragon of Alexstrasza's flight, broken by Nefarian's experiments. He asks to be killed before the corruption finishes taking him, and apologises while he fights."},
    [16926]={name="Bindings of Transcendence",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Razorgore the Untamed in Blackwing Lair.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Razorgore the Untamed",lore="Set to guard the stolen dragon eggs. The raid takes control of the orb he is chained to and turns him on the clutch he was protecting."},
    [16975]={name="Warsong Sash",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Warsong Supplies” — pick it over the other choices. In Ashenvale.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Warsong Supplies",lore="We are in short supply of a few items at the Warsong lumber camp!"},
    [16985]={name="Windseeker Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “New Life” — pick it over the other choices. In Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="New Life",lore="As you have seen, though the land is in pain, the cycle of life is a powerful thing. Now we must do our part help it along. You must plant these seeds at the center of the destruction, to the west, in the Charred Vale."},
