    [23220]={name="Crystal Webbed Robe",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Maexxna in Naxxramas.",zone="Naxxramas",npc="Maexxna",lore="A giant spider webbed into the depths of the Arachnid Quarter, fed on whatever the Scourge no longer needs."},
    [23323]={name="Crown of the Fire Festival",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “A Thief's Reward”.",questName="A Thief's Reward",seasonal=true,lore="This flame, stolen from the heart of Stormwind itself, floods you with warmth. This raw power is foreign to you, but the (NAME) might know more..."},
    [23324]={name="Mantle of the Fire Festival",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Wild Fires in the Eastern Kingdoms”.",questName="Wild Fires in the Eastern Kingdoms",seasonal=true,lore="Our celebration of the flame is spread throughout the land. Not a single place remains untouched by the heat of this holiday, and the strongest fires burn a brilliant blue."},
    [23401]={name="Divining Crystal",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Deactivate An'owyn” — pick it over the other choices. In Ghostlands.",zone="Ghostlands",questName="Deactivate An'owyn",lore="They're keyed so that they can be turned off. You must go to An'owyn, retrieve the controlling orb from one of the night elves and then use it on the moon crystal to stop them from enacting their plan!"},
    [23402]={name="Arcanist's Dagger",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Windrunner Village” — pick it over the other choices. In Ghostlands.",zone="Ghostlands",questName="Windrunner Village",lore="the final battle against the Ghostlands villages is upon you. Windrunner Village to the southwest has been overrun by a large force of the more powerful Scourge shocktroopers; shades and gargoyles."},
    [23407]={name="Supple Cotton Bracer",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Assault on Zeb'Nowa” — pick it over the other choices. In Ghostlands.",zone="Ghostlands",questName="Assault on Zeb'Nowa",lore="Time for something a little more challenging. Zeb'Nowa, to the south, is where the more powerful Shadowpine trolls make their home."},
    [23411]={name="Well Crafted Staff",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Bring Me Kel'gash's Head!” — pick it over the other choices. In Ghostlands.",zone="Ghostlands",questName="Bring Me Kel'gash's Head!",lore="WANTED: Bring the head of Kel'gash the Wicked, chieftain of the Shadowpine trolls, to Captain Helios. No questions asked. Kel'gash is known to dwell somewhere to the south in Zeb'Nowa."},
    [23413]={name="Troll Kickers",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Escape from the Catacombs” — pick it over the other choices. In Ghostlands.",zone="Ghostlands",questName="Escape from the Catacombs",lore="These trolls ambushed me and have been keeping me in this cage. I think they're planning to sacrifice me! Help me get out of here! The lock on the cage isn't that complex..."},
    [23761]={name="Power Amplification Goggles",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering"},
    [23828]={name="Gnomish Power Goggles",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering"},
    [23844]={name="Nolkai's Lantern",sourceType="container",instructions="Found inside another item."},
    [24109]={name="Thick Ravager Belt",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Beasts of the Apocalypse!” — pick it over the other choices. In Azuremyst Isle.",zone="Azuremyst Isle",questName="Beasts of the Apocalypse!",lore="My brother and I were hunting in the woods to the east when we were ambushed by strange, insect-like beasts. Such aberrations have never before been seen in Azuremyst!"},
    [24112]={name="Kurkenstoks",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Kurken's Hide” — pick it over the other choices. In Azuremyst Isle.",zone="Azuremyst Isle",questName="The Kurken's Hide",lore="Take the Kurken's hide to Moordo, on the other side of the village. He will fashion the hide into an item of your choice."},
    [24113]={name="Cowlen's Bracers of Kinship",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “A Cry For Help”. In Azuremyst Isle.",zone="Azuremyst Isle",questName="A Cry For Help",lore="My family was attacked by the murlocs and owlkin of this island several weeks ago. I managed to escape but I think that both my mother and father have been slain."},
    [24120]={name="Seal of Argas",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Never Again!” — pick it over the other choices. In Ashenvale.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Never Again!",lore="it falls to you to see that this attack by the Burning Legion never comes to pass. You must go and slay their leaders. Without them the rest of the demons are essentially mindless."},
    [24254]={name="White Remedy Cape",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [24340]={name="Vandril's Hand Me Down Pants",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Anok'suten” — pick it over the other choices. In Ghostlands.",zone="Ghostlands",questName="Anok'suten",lore="Come closer, I am... dying. I was sent here... to slay these nerubians, but Vandril didn't... know that they have a leader. You must find and..."},
    [24354]={name="Staff of the Hand",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Ending Their World” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Ending Their World",lore="Don't accept this assignment if you value your life. You see that gigantic power core jutting out of the mountain side over yonder?"},
    [24359]={name="Princely Reign Leggings",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Mennu the Betrayer in The Slave Pens.",zone="The Slave Pens",npc="Mennu the Betrayer"},
    [24380]={name="Calming Spore Reed",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Rokmar the Crackler in The Slave Pens.",zone="The Slave Pens",npc="Rokmar the Crackler"},
    [24390]={name="Auslese's Light Channeler",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Broggok in The Blood Furnace.",zone="The Blood Furnace",npc="Broggok",proc="Use: Reduces the cost of your next spell cast within 10 sec by up to 215 mana. (3 Min Cooldown)"},
    [24462]={name="Luminous Pearls of Insight",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ghaz'an in The Underbog.",zone="The Underbog",npc="Ghaz'an"},
    [25503]={name="Flamehandler's Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Marking the Path” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="Marking the Path",lore="With the rock flayer population thinned, all that's left is to signal the safe path to our pilgrims. Return to the Great Fissure with this torch and seek the three beacons that mark the path from the east."},
    [25525]={name="Zangar Epaulets",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Stealing Back the Mushrooms” — pick it over the other choices. In Zangarmarsh.",zone="Zangarmarsh",questName="Stealing Back the Mushrooms",lore="I've got an idea. I want you to head north again, this time into the heart of ogre territory! Northwest of the Hewn Bog there is a place named Ango'rosh Stronghold, which sits on a floating island across a large mushroom bridge."},
    [25629]={name="Ogre Handler's Shooter",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Bleeding Hollow Supply Crates” — pick it over the other choices. In Nagrand.",zone="Nagrand",questName="Bleeding Hollow Supply Crates",lore="The Boulderfist have moved the supplies they stole from our village to the twin clefts of Nagrand, found west of here in the Halaani Basin. While you are in the area, keep your eye out for the supply crates."},
    [25632]={name="Wand of Happiness",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Corki's Gone Missing Again!” — pick it over the other choices. In Nagrand.",zone="Nagrand",questName="Corki's Gone Missing Again!",lore="This is so embarrassing. Do you remember my boy, Corki? You rescued him from the Burning Blade Ruins recently. Well, his curiosity has gotten the best of him once more."},
    [25718]={name="Mantle of Magical Might",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Weaken the Ramparts” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Citadel.",zone="Hellfire Citadel",questName="Weaken the Ramparts",lore="Quick, there isn't much time. Thrallmar's existence balances on the razor's edge! We're caught between Hellfire Citadel in the west and the Burning Legion to the east."},
    [25760]={name="Battle Mage's Baton",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Ring of Blood: The Final Challenge” — pick it over the other choices. In Nagrand.",zone="Nagrand",questName="The Ring of Blood: The Final Challenge",lore="You've made me a lot of money, kid. If you can defeat Mogor, I promise to make it worth your while. All that pain you suffered in the Ring of Blood is gonna end up paying off."},
    [25785]={name="Adept's Band",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “A Job for an Intelligent Man” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="A Job for an Intelligent Man",lore="As if the gan'arg that overran the mines aren't bad enough, now we've got gigantic worms encroaching on us from the other direction!"},
    [25792]={name="Curate's Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Fel Embers” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Citadel.",zone="Hellfire Citadel",questName="Fel Embers",lore="The stuffy academics of Azeroth have cowered in their towers for too long and it's fallen to me to show them what cutting edge research is!"},
    [25822]={name="Watcher's Tunic",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Forge Camp: Annihilated” — pick it over the other choices. In Nagrand.",zone="Nagrand",questName="Forge Camp: Annihilated",lore="Gather your allies. You will need them if you are to face an overseer. Once you have a suitable group, find and kill the overseers at each camp."},
    [25939]={name="Voidfire Wand",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Pandemonius in Mana-Tombs.",zone="Mana-Tombs",npc="Pandemonius"},
    [25945]={name="Cloak of Revival",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Tavarok in Mana-Tombs.",zone="Mana-Tombs",npc="Tavarok"},
    [25957]={name="Ethereal Boots of the Skystrider",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Nexus-Prince Shaffar in Mana-Tombs.",zone="Mana-Tombs",npc="Nexus-Prince Shaffar"},
    [25982]={name="Foreman's Sash",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Mastermind” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="The Mastermind",lore="Those infernal gan'arg keep scurrying into the mine! For each one you kill, two or three more seem to take its place! There's got to be someone down there in the deepest reaches of the mine directing the incursion."},
    [25989]={name="Draenethyst Chaplet",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “BETA Looking to the Leadership” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="BETA Looking to the Leadership",lore="The disturbances at Expedition Armory continue, despite your best efforts. No one truly knows everything that happened there, nor exactly what binds the spirits of the fallen soldiers to the ruins."},
    [26012]={name="Kessel's Cinch Wrap",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Declaration of Power” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Declaration of Power",lore="Have you seen the serpent men? The ones that call themselves naga? They dared make an advance upon this camp under cover of darkness only three nights ago."},
    [26013]={name="Cincture of Woven Reeds",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Culling the Flutterers” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Culling the Flutterers",lore="When we first encountered flutterers, they showed few signs of mutation. As the corruption got progressively worse, the moths and other species began to show signs of contamination."},
    [26014]={name="Maatparm's Fungus Lined Cuffs",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Mac'Aree Mushroom Menagerie” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Mac'Aree Mushroom Menagerie",lore="I am in need of mushrooms for my collection. Scattered throughout these unexplored wilds you will find four different types: An aquatic stinkhorn, a blood mushroom, a ruinous polyspore, and a fel cone fungus."},
    [26050]={name="Fist of Argus",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Blood Watch” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Blood Watch",lore="Blood Watch is one of two forward bases operated by the Hand of Argus."},
    [26055]={name="Oculus of the Hidden Eye",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Shirrak the Dead Watcher in Auchenai Crypts.",zone="Auchenai Crypts",npc="Shirrak the Dead Watcher",proc="Use: The next opponent you kill within 10 sec that yields experience or honor will restore 900 mana. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [27398]={name="Carved Crystalline Orb",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “WANTED: Deathclaw” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="WANTED: Deathclaw",lore="By order of Harbinger Mikolaas: A bounty of 18 silver to be paid to the brave soul who returns with proof of the marauding bear Deathclaw's demise."},
    [27403]={name="Stillpine Stinger",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Prophecy of Akida” — pick it over the other choices. In Azuremyst Isle.",zone="Azuremyst Isle",questName="The Prophecy of Akida",lore="The images on this totem depict a war between the Stillpine and the Bristlelimb furbolg tribes."},
    [27404]={name="Lightspark",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Containing the Threat” — pick it over the other choices. In Bloodmyst Isle.",zone="Bloodmyst Isle",questName="Containing the Threat",lore="Now that we have made our presence known to the satyr, we must send a message that we will not tolerate the Burning Legion's hounds in these lands."},
    [27411]={name="Slippers of Serenity",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Exarch Maladaar in Auchenai Crypts.",zone="Auchenai Crypts",npc="Exarch Maladaar"},
    [27433]={name="Pauldrons of Sufferance",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Epoch Hunter.",npc="Epoch Hunter"},
    [27525]={name="Jeweled Boots of Sanctification",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Warbringer O'mrogg in The Shattered Halls.",zone="The Shattered Halls",npc="Warbringer O'mrogg"},
    [27791]={name="Serpentcrest Life-Staff",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Mekgineer Steamrigger in The Steamvault.",zone="The Steamvault",npc="Mekgineer Steamrigger"},
    [27885]={name="Soul-Wand of the Aldor",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ambassador Hellmaw in Shadow Labyrinth.",zone="Shadow Labyrinth",npc="Ambassador Hellmaw"},
    [27922]={name="Mark of Defiance",sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Alliance Field Scout in Telredor — costs tokens or reputation.",zone="Telredor",npc="Alliance Field Scout",proc="Equip: Chance on spell hit to restore 128 to 172 mana to the bearer. (Proc chance: 15%, 17s cooldown)"},
    [27946]={name="Avian Cloak of Feathers",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Talon King Ikiss in Sethekk Halls.",zone="Sethekk Halls",npc="Talon King Ikiss"},
    [27948]={name="Trousers of Oblivion",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Talon King Ikiss in Sethekk Halls.",zone="Sethekk Halls",npc="Talon King Ikiss"},
    [27981]={name="Sethekk Oracle Cloak",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Talon King Ikiss in Sethekk Halls.",zone="Sethekk Halls",npc="Talon King Ikiss"},
    [27994]={name="Mantle of Three Terrors",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Chrono Lord Deja.",npc="Chrono Lord Deja"},
    [28033]={name="Epoch-Mender",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Temporus.",npc="Temporus"},
    [28075]={name="Destroyers' Mantle",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Natural Remedies” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="Natural Remedies",lore="It must be that the evil emanations from that giant crystal are summoning the mountain giants and driving them insane. It's too big to move, and beyond our ability to destroy, but I know a way to quell its power."},
    [28134]={name="Brooch of Heightened Potential",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Blackheart the Inciter in Shadow Labyrinth.",zone="Shadow Labyrinth",npc="Blackheart the Inciter"},
    [28141]={name="Ranger's Sash",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Curbing the Plague” — pick it over the other choices. In Ghostlands.",zone="Ghostlands",questName="Curbing the Plague",lore="You've proven your worth as an ally. I need you to continue your task and track down more plagued wildlife. This time seek out some of the more dangerous beasts."},
    [28144]={name="Troll Handler Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Report to Captain Helios” — pick it over the other choices. In Ghostlands.",zone="Ghostlands",questName="Report to Captain Helios",lore="I need one last favor of you. Just in case Ranger Salissa didn't make it back to Farstrider Enclave on the south edge of the lake, I need you to go there and get help."},
    [28146]={name="Courier's Wraps",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Delivery to Tranquillien” — pick it over the other choices. In Ghostlands.",zone="Ghostlands",questName="Delivery to Tranquillien",lore="I... I'm too weak to continue. I carry a dire warning from Regent Lord Theron, in the form of a letter. You'll have to deliver it for me. Take it to Arcanist Vandril in Tranquillien."},
    [28151]={name="Arcanist's Wand",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Windrunner Village” — pick it over the other choices. In Ghostlands.",zone="Ghostlands",questName="Windrunner Village",lore="the final battle against the Ghostlands villages is upon you. Windrunner Village to the southwest has been overrun by a large force of the more powerful Scourge shocktroopers; shades and gargoyles."},
    [28155]={name="Apothecary's Waistband",sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Provisioner Vredigar in Tranquillien.",zone="Tranquillien",npc="Provisioner Vredigar"},
    [28169]={name="Mag'hari Ritualist's Horns",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Hero of the Mag'har” — pick it over the other choices. In Nagrand.",zone="Nagrand",questName="Hero of the Mag'har",lore="I must set things in order before I leave. Return to the Greatmother and tell her that her grandson comes."},
    [28187]={name="Star-Heart Lamp",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Temporus.",npc="Temporus"},
    [28303]={name="Invoker's Signet",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Wanted: Knucklerot and Luzran” — pick it over the other choices. In Ghostlands.",zone="Ghostlands",questName="Wanted: Knucklerot and Luzran",lore="A bounty is hereby declared for the abominations known as Knucklerot and Luzran. These dreadful creations of Dar'Khan are extremely dangerous and have been sighted patrolling near the Howling and Bleeding Ziggurats."},
    [28555]={name="Seal of the Exorcist",sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Spirit Sage Gartok in Stonebreaker Hold — costs tokens or reputation.",zone="Stonebreaker Hold",npc="Spirit Sage Gartok"},
    [29157]={name="Golden Ring of Power",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Jewelcrafting (requires skill 1).",profession="Jewelcrafting"},
    [29159]={name="Glowing Thorium Band",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Jewelcrafting (requires skill 1).",profession="Jewelcrafting"},
    [29315]={name="Gloves of Penitence",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Levixus the Soul Caller” — pick it over the other choices. In Auchindoun.",zone="Auchindoun",questName="Levixus the Soul Caller",lore="Go now. You will find Levixus on the uppermost ruins of Auchindoun. Enter there from the southern reaches of the Bone Wastes. He stands amidst a storm of souls..."},
    [29328]={name="Consortium Prince's Wrap",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Someone Else's Hard Work Pays Off” — pick it over the other choices. In Mana-Tombs.",zone="Mana-Tombs",questName="Someone Else's Hard Work Pays Off",lore="Who were you expecting!? That idiot Morphalius was 'de-prioritized.' Now I'm here to clean up his mess. All I need from you is to watch my back as I go through Shaffar's ether gatherers and suck them dry of all that they have collected."},
    [29779]={name="Rejuvenating Scepter",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Ar'kelos the Guardian” — pick it over the other choices. In Netherstorm.",zone="Netherstorm",questName="Ar'kelos the Guardian",lore="Now that you've gathered all the items I'll need to break Kael'thas's curse, one thing remains to be done. When Kael'thas sealed the tower, he placed an arcane golem, known as Ar'kelos, at the bottom of the tower."},
    [29780]={name="Kirin Tor Apprentice's Robes",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Destroy Naberius!” — pick it over the other choices. In Netherstorm.",zone="Netherstorm",questName="Destroy Naberius!",lore="Archmage Vargoth saw the danger in Naberius's pursuit of necromancy, but I don't think he ever anticipated that his own apprentice would wreak this much destruction upon the Kirin Tor."},
    [29808]={name="Shimmering Azure Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Securing the Celestial Ridge” — pick it over the other choices. In Netherstorm.",zone="Netherstorm",questName="Securing the Celestial Ridge",lore="The nether dragons have the same ferocious temperament as their black dragon forbears, but there is something entirely alien about them."},
    [29814]={name="Celestial Jewel Ring",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Hitting the Motherlode” — pick it over the other choices. In Netherstorm.",zone="Netherstorm",questName="Hitting the Motherlode",lore="Now that we've got a good baseline product, we're going to need something of higher quality. Certainly the farahlite we've gathered so far is nice, but I know there's better out there."},
    [29910]={name="The Staff of Twin Worlds",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Felspark Ravine” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="Felspark Ravine",lore="Doom Lord Kazzak commands the Burning Legion in Outland. While we can't get to Kazzak - yet - we can and must get to his lieutenants that command Legion troops from the ground."},
    [29915]={name="Desolation Rod",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Bonechewer Blood” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="Bonechewer Blood",lore="Bonechewers! They should all die! The sight of their red skin and depravity makes my blood boil! I have a mission for you. Kill bonechewer orcs and collect their vile blood."},
    [29926]={name="Whispering Tunic",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Mission: The Abyssal Shelf” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="Mission: The Abyssal Shelf",lore="Now that you've got your wings, perhaps you'd be interested in running another bombing mission? This time we've isolated the Legion's main production area, behind the forge camps to the north."},
    [29927]={name="Shadowbrim Travel Hat",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Disrupt Their Reinforcements” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="Disrupt Their Reinforcements",lore="You'll find the Legion front to our northeast, and spaced along it are portals used to gather reinforcements from throughout Outland. We, are going to destroy those portals!"},
    [29928]={name="Wanderer's Stitched Trousers",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Laying Waste to the Unwanted” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="Laying Waste to the Unwanted",lore="Now that we've gotten our salvage operation off the ground, it's time to begin the second phase of the plan. Across the Path of Glory, the Horde still has their old blade throwers trained on us."},
    [30011]={name="Ameer's Impulse Taser",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Nexus-King Salhadaar” — pick it over the other choices. In Netherstorm.",zone="Netherstorm",questName="Nexus-King Salhadaar",lore="I have in my possession another disruptor, one capable of destroying the three conduits that surround Salhadaar. Once the conduits are destroyed, Salhadaar's protective force fields will be down."},
    [30256]={name="Pants of the Naaru",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Special Delivery to Shattrath City” — pick it over the other choices. In Shattrath City.",zone="Shattrath City",questName="Special Delivery to Shattrath City",lore="You have truly inspired me. I am now going to give you the ata'mal crystal to hand over to the naaru."},
    [30377]={name="Karja's Medallion",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Shutting Down Manaforge Ara” — pick it over the other choices. In Netherstorm.",zone="Netherstorm",questName="Shutting Down Manaforge Ara",lore="One manaforge is all that keeps Tempest Keep functional. After we bring Manaforge Ara down, Kael will have to resort to depleting whatever energy he's got stored up."},
    [30419]={name="Brilliant Necklace",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Jewelcrafting (requires skill 1).",profession="Jewelcrafting"},
    [30422]={name="Diamond Focus Ring",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Jewelcrafting (requires skill 1).",profession="Jewelcrafting"},
    [30464]={name="Lifeblood Bracers",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [30465]={name="Lifeblood Leggings",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [30519]={name="Boots of the Nexus Warden",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Flesh Lies...” — pick it over the other choices. In Netherstorm.",zone="Netherstorm",questName="The Flesh Lies...",lore="You see these corpses? Arconus is responsible for this slaughter. He's sucked them dry, leaving nothing more than a fleshy husk. But don't let the bodies fool you!"},
    [30857]={name="Deep Core Lantern",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Beneath Thrallmar” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="Beneath Thrallmar",lore="I can't send my peons in and even once I fix this shredder I wouldn't want to risk it in combat. Deep down in the mine the gan'arg have a leader."},
    [30859]={name="Wand of the Seer",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Turning Point” — pick it over the other choices. In Netherstorm.",zone="Netherstorm",questName="Turning Point",lore="This is the chance we've been waiting for. Not only have we uncovered the evidence we need to show our people who Kael'thas is really working for, but we can prove our strength by defeating his new masters."},
    [30924]={name="Gloves of the High Magus",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “News of Victory” — pick it over the other choices. In Shadowmoon Valley.",zone="Shadowmoon Valley",questName="News of Victory",lore="You must bring word of our success to Kurdran Wildhammer immediately! His men, under Wing Commander Nuainn, have fought nonstop to keep Wildhammer Stronghold safe and your return will surely bolster their spirits."},
    [30925]={name="Spaulders of the Torn-heart",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Cipher of Damnation - The Third Fragment Recovered” — pick it over the other choices. In Shadowmoon Valley.",zone="Shadowmoon Valley",questName="The Cipher of Damnation - The Third Fragment Recovered",lore="Take this box to my father. He still resides at Oronok's Farm, far to the north, above Coilskar Cistern. When all three fragments are pieced together, the ancient words will be known once more."},
    [30926]={name="Ashwalker's Footwraps",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Capture the Weapons” — pick it over the other choices. In Shadowmoon Valley.",zone="Shadowmoon Valley",questName="Capture the Weapons",lore="With a larger supply of this material, we might be able to forge a weapon for you to use. The two pit lords at Legion Hold, Makazradon and Morgroron, have already been equipped with these anti-demon weapons."},
    [30932]={name="Akama's Sash",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Akama's Promise” — pick it over the other choices. In Shadowmoon Valley.",zone="Shadowmoon Valley",questName="Akama's Promise",lore="I am not as strong as I once was. Being so close to evil itself all these years - I do not know if I can trust myself with an artifact as powerful as this."},
    [31140]={name="Cloak of Entropy",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 176 creature types around level 59-68. Also found on the auction house."},
    [31149]={name="Gloves of Pandemonium",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 227 creature types around level 60-63. Also found on the auction house."},
    [31150]={name="Gloves of Piety",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 227 creature types around level 60-63. Also found on the auction house."},
    [31230]={name="Abyss Walker's Boots",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 227 creature types around level 63-70. Also found on the auction house."},
    [31264]={name="Silvermoon Robes",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Fenissa the Assassin (rare spawn) in The Vector Coil.",zone="The Vector Coil",npc="Fenissa the Assassin"},
    [31270]={name="Banshee Rod",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Dr. Whitherlimb (rare spawn) in Deatholme.",zone="Deatholme",npc="Dr. Whitherlimb"},
    [31282]={name="Shroud of Spiritual Purity",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 370 creature types around level 65-70. Also found on the auction house."},
    [31283]={name="Sash of Sealed Fate",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 370 creature types around level 65-70. Also found on the auction house."},
    [31297]={name="Robe of the Crimson Order",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 684 creature types around level 67-72. Also found on the auction house."},
    [31383]={name="Spiritualist's Mark of the Sha'tar",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Battle of the Crimson Watch” — pick it over the other choices. In Shadowmoon Valley.",zone="Shadowmoon Valley",questName="Battle of the Crimson Watch",lore="They are probably searching for you on the Path of Conquest as we speak. You must make your escape! Leave me, I'm done for... They... I think I hear them coming."},
    [31546]={name="Tourmaline Crown",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Showdown” — pick it over the other choices. In Blade's Edge Mountains.",zone="Blade's Edge Mountains",questName="Showdown",lore="Now it comes to this. We will bring Goc forth from his lair, and we will destroy him. With Goc dead, the Bladespire ogres will threaten the Mok'Nathal no longer."},
    [31691]={name="Natasha's Guardian Cord",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Hound-Master” — pick it over the other choices. In Blade's Edge Mountains.",zone="Blade's Edge Mountains",questName="The Hound-Master",lore="Baelmon the Hound-Master must die! He maintains the ritual that keeps the portal functioning. The Death's Door portal is located at the north end of the canyon."},
    [31692]={name="Natasha's Ember Necklace",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Hound-Master” — pick it over the other choices. In Blade's Edge Mountains.",zone="Blade's Edge Mountains",questName="The Hound-Master",lore="Baelmon the Hound-Master must die! He maintains the ritual that keeps the portal functioning. The Death's Door portal is located at the north end of the canyon."},
    [31699]={name="Imbued Draenethyst Crystal",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Teleport This!” — pick it over the other choices. In Netherstorm.",zone="Netherstorm",questName="Teleport This!",lore="As fun as killing demons might be, it does us little good when the Legion can keep using its teleporters to replace anything we kill. Unfortunately, I don't have any high-powered explosives handy..."},
    [31715]={name="Demoniac Soul Prison",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Demoniac Scryer”. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="The Demoniac Scryer",lore="The Demoniac Scryer is now ready."},
    [31717]={name="Shadowcast Tunic",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Foot of the Citadel” — pick it over the other choices. In Hellfire Peninsula.",zone="Hellfire Peninsula",questName="The Foot of the Citadel",lore="Force Commander Gorax is training Shattered Hand captains at the base of Hellfire Citadel, honing them to a bloody razor's edge. You must kill him, for his loss would be a mighty blow to the fel orcs."},
    [32494]={name="Destruction Holo-gogs",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Allows you to look far into the distance. (3 Sec Cooldown)"},
    [32495]={name="Powerheal 4000 Lens",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering",proc="Use: Allows you to look far into the distance. (3 Sec Cooldown)"},
    [33266]={name="Book of the Adept",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Unleash the Raptors” — pick it over the other choices. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Unleash the Raptors",lore="Now that we've got our raptors, our next move is to \"encourage\" them to attack the Grimtotems at Blackhoof Village to the northwest. I've got a leftover haunch of..."},
    [34416]={name="Gloves of the Dune",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Rise of the Silithid” — pick it over the other choices. In Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="Rise of the Silithid",lore="I am entrusting you with a copy of the report Raschal made on the infestation of southeastern Feralas. While the main report is being filed in Darnassus, I want you to give this copy to an associate of the Protectorate."},
    [34418]={name="Scrying Wand",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “A Future Task” — pick it over the other choices. In Ironforge.",zone="Ironforge",questName="A Future Task",lore="Well... we seem to be at a temporary dead end here. We know what we need - the Plates of Uldum - but we have no idea where they might be. We'll need to do quite a bit of research on this to come up with a solid plan of attack."},
    [34424]={name="Power of the High Chief",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Words of the High Chief” — pick it over the other choices. In Winterspring.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Words of the High Chief",lore="The Winterfall are no longer a threat to me, but if you still want to find out what was driving the furbolg to create and consume this strange firewater, I think you should seek out Kelek Skykeeper."},
}

